OL,3,GNEWSAMajor council care home sell-off
OL,4,Ascrapped by Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major sell-off of local
OL,7,Fauthority care homes have been pulled
OL,8,Fafter a review found it was "not in the
OL,9,Fbest interests" of the council.
OL,11,FNorfolk County Council had planned to
OL,12,Fsell 20 homes to another operator along
OL,13,Fwith the council-owned company that ran
OL,14,Fthem, Norse Care.
OL,16,FThe proposal caused concern among
OL,17,Fopposition groups at the Reform UK-led
OL,18,Fcouncil, who worried fees could
OL,19,Fincrease. Following a rethink, it has
OL,20,Fnow been withdrawn.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
