OL,3,GNEWSAMajor council care home sell-off
OL,4,Ascrapped by Reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FNick Taylor, Reform's cabinet member
OL,7,Ffor commercial assets, said they no
OL,8,Flonger thought it was the "best deal on
OL,9,Fthe table" and that alternative options
OL,10,Fwere now being considered.
